# Vercel's Python runtime switched to `uv` for dep resolution but their
# deploy step still lstat's `.dist-info/INSTALLER` — which uv intentionally
# does not write. Any Python function with a non-trivial requirements.txt
# hits ENOENT at deploy time. Until Vercel fixes that, exclude the two
# Python-backed routes from the deploy. The frontend (scenarioEngine.ts)
# already falls back gracefully on 5xx / network errors for these endpoints.
api/risk-engine
api/scenarios
